  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "opening-01",
      "speaker": "narration",
      "text": "雨停在最后一节课结束前。校门外的路面还湿着，风里有一点树叶和泥土的味道。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-02"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-02",
      "speaker": "thought",
      "text": "明明只是几天没来，站在这里，却有种错过了整整一个季节的感觉。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-03"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-03",
      "speaker": "tang",
      "text": "你准备在这里站到保安把门锁上吗？",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "笑意"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "enter",
      "next": "opening-04"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-04",
      "speaker": "me",
      "text": "我在确认自己有没有走错学校。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "平静"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-05"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-05",
      "speaker": "tang",
      "text": "那你放心。能把这个门认错的人，我们年级大概只剩你了。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "打趣"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-06"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-06",
      "speaker": "thought",
      "text": "熟悉的声音一出现，刚才那点陌生感就散了。虽然他说的并不是什么好听的话。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-07"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-07",
      "speaker": "me",
      "text": "几天不见，你迎接人的方式还是很特别。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "无奈"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-08"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-08",
      "speaker": "tang",
      "text": "谁说我是来迎接你的？我只是……刚好路过。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "别开视线"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-09"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-09",
      "speaker": "narration",
      "text": "他把肩上的书包往上提了一点。另一只手里，却还拿着两盒没有拆封的牛奶。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-10"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-10",
      "speaker": "me",
      "text": "刚好路过，还刚好买了两份？",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "打趣"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-11"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-11",
      "speaker": "tang",
      "text": "第二份打折。你要是不喝，我就留着明天。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "不自在"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-12"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-12",
      "speaker": "thought",
      "text": "他说得很快。我没有拆穿，只是伸手接了过来。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-13"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-13",
      "speaker": "me",
      "text": "那谢谢你替我省钱。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "微笑"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "平静"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-14"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-14",
      "speaker": "tang",
      "text": "……你回来以后，果然还是挺烦人的。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
          "position": "right",
          "expression": "笑意"
        }
      ],
      "motion": "",
      "next": "opening-15"
    },
    {
      "id": "opening-15",
      "speaker": "narration",
      "text": "包装盒碰在一起，发出轻轻的一声。我们谁都没有立刻往校门外走。",
      "bg": "campus",
      "chapter": "序章 · 又一次，放学以后",
      "cast": [
        {
          "actor": "me",
          "position": "left",
          "expression": "聆听"
        },
        {
          "actor": "tang",
